KG42.register("clusters-a6c9d7379abad9701576e66c",{"id":"04-energy_collectives::v142-d-K003","paper":"04-energy_collectives","label":"Manager influence on members' income and payments through the common agreement","record":{"cluster_id":"v142-d-K003","label":"Manager influence on members' income and payments through the common agreement","market_meaning":"The community manager influences members' income and payments through the common agreement and the external market interface. At present, only the scope of responsibilities and influence can be determined; the full amounts for each member, the parties subject to charges, and payment obligations cannot yet be determined.","mechanism_ids":["v141-a-M01"],"market_types":["LEM"],"process_stages":["settlement","coordination"],"scope_disposition":"compatible","scope_explanation":"Both chains involve the M01 manager and the common agreement. The sharing of R003 serves only to describe responsibilities and the agreement interface; its Eq. (19) is not directly interpreted as a member settlement formula, and the optional charging model from M02 is not imported.","assembly_status":"partial","boundary_rationale":"Members' income and payments have distinct meanings in terms of accounting and obligations; qualitative influence cannot be treated as complete settlement merely because the manager also participates in clearing.","chain_bindings":[{"chain_id":"v141-c-R010","ownership":"primary","role":"core","rationale":"Retains the direct statement that the manager influences members' income and payments."},{"chain_id":"v141-c-R003","ownership":"shared","role":"interface","rationale":"Supplements only the common agreement and responsibilities for the external interface; its primary assignment remains with the community clearing cluster."}],"connections":[{"connection_id":"v142-d-K003-C01","from_chain_id":"v141-c-R003","to_chain_id":"v141-c-R010","kind":"functional_coupling","from_refs":["v141-c-R003::phi::v141-c-R003-C001","v141-c-R003::phi::v141-c-R003-C002"],"to_refs":["v141-c-R010::phi::v141-c-R010-C001"],"evidence_ids":["v141-b-g01-E11","v141-b-g02-e35"],"rationale":"The source explicitly assigns implementation of the common agreement to the manager and states that it affects members' income and payments; this connection is limited to qualitative influence and does not establish a dependency for calculating amounts."}],"object_mappings":[{"mapping_id":"v142-d-K003-M01","kind":"same_node","member_refs":["v141-c-R003::V::coordination.local_operator","v141-c-R010::V::coordination.local_operator"],"canonical_ref":"v141-c-R003::V::coordination.local_operator","display_policy":"single_representative","evidence_ids":["v141-b-g01-E11","v141-b-g02-e35"],"rationale":"The same M01 manager is responsible for the agreement interface and influences members' income and payments; a unified display of the node does not imply that its objective is equivalent to settlement."}],"gaps":[{"gap_id":"v142-d-K003-G01","category":"math_incomplete","description":"R010 has no variables for member payments or income, pricing basis, settlement identities, or charging conditions; complete payment obligations cannot be specified on the basis of qualitative influence.","chain_ids":["v141-c-R010"],"object_refs":["v141-c-R010::phi::v141-c-R010-C001"],"evidence_ids":["v141-b-g02-e35"],"proposal_ids":[],"required_work":"Have C supplement the definitions of member amounts and the settlement basis for the same mechanism, or explicitly and permanently restrict this chain to a statement of procedural influence."},{"gap_id":"v142-d-K003-G02","category":"ontology_extension","description":"Perceived price is an evaluation quantity obtained by normalizing members' income and payments by energy use; it cannot directly substitute for payment obligations or the community clearing price. Its denominator and the correspondence involving λ_com remain unresolved, and the relevant proposals have not been approved.","chain_ids":["v141-c-R010"],"object_refs":["v141-c-R010::V::settlement.payment"],"evidence_ids":["v141-b-g02-e31","v141-b-g02-e32","v141-b-g03-E05","v141-b-g03-E06"],"proposal_ids":["v141-b-g02-prop-02","v141-b-g03-P02"],"required_work":"Manually distinguish perceived price from settlement objects, check l_j, λ_com, and the conditions under which the denominator applies, and then decide whether to revise the scope of C's objects and evidence."},{"gap_id":"v142-d-K003-G03","category":"unverified_source","description":"Neither the evidence on responsibilities and effects on income and payments nor the potential evidence on perceived price has undergone independent source review.","chain_ids":["v141-c-R003","v141-c-R010"],"object_refs":[],"evidence_ids":["v141-b-g01-E11","v141-b-g02-e35","v141-b-g02-e31"],"proposal_ids":[],"required_work":"Subsequently, manually check the original text; at present, do not claim that the settlement mechanism has been verified on the basis of candidate eligibility."}]},"rule_refs":["04-energy_collectives::v141-c-R010","04-energy_collectives::v141-c-R003"],"unresolved_rule_refs":[],"node_ids":["COMP-d9f2e855b5c1b845","KG31-3fa7c9f6716d2240"]});
